# Only package.json, README.md, LICENSE, the bundled dist/extension.js and the licenses of what it bundles go into
# the .vsix.
# syntaxes/ stays out on purpose: the extension copies the Verse grammar from the user's own engine checkout at run
# time, so the package never redistributes Epic Games files.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!dist/extension.js
!dist/ThirdPartyNotices.txt
